buoy-wm (1.0.0~rc.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install steps for Ubuntu 26.04 and 26.10 now use this .deb, and each
    supported release was verified on a clean machine from the README.
  * --version on the three binaries; every release installs the package
    in a clean container and runs it before publishing.
  * Minimum Rust lowered to 1.93, Ubuntu 26.04's rustc.

 -- Nick Booth <n1cck@onlyhams.radio>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:05:20 -0500

buoy-wm (1.0.0~rc.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The release assets now include a .deb for each supported Ubuntu
